    "tiles": {
      "0": {
        "content": "# Home Commander v2\n\nHost **commander.lindleyhome.com** \u2014 Home Commander API behind nginx.\n\n**Routes:** `/api/fleet/*` (host-facts sync), `/api/cmdb/*`, `/api/workflows/*`.\n\n**Path:** Dynatrace workflows \u2192 EdgeConnect on **dt01** \u2192 HTTPS commander.\n\n**Automation:** OneAgent \u00b7 CMDB Sync WFs \u00b7 nginx silence + fleet-sync silence detectors.",
        "title": "",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      "1": {
        "davis": {
          "davisVisualization": {
            "isAvailable": true
          },
          "enabled": false
        },
        "query": "fetch logs\n| filter host.name == \"commander.lindleyhome.com\" and log.source == \"/var/log/nginx/access.log\"\n| summarize requests = count()",
        "querySettings": {
          "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
          "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
          "enableSampling": false,
          "maxResultMegaBytes": 10,
          "maxResultRecords": 1000
        },
        "title": "Nginx requests",
        "type": "data",
        "visualization": "singleValue",
        "visualizationSettings": {
          "singleValue": {
            "recordField": "requests"
          }
        }
      },
      "2": {
        "davis": {
          "davisVisualization": {
            "isAvailable": true
          },
          "enabled": false
        },
        "query": "fetch logs\n| filter host.name == \"commander.lindleyhome.com\" and log.source == \"/var/log/nginx/access.log\"\n| filter contains(content, \"/api/fleet/\")\n| summarize hits = count()",
        "querySettings": {
          "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
          "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
